        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-5 p-5 md:p-6 rounded-xl border animate-on-scroll" style="animation-delay: 0.08s; border-color: hsl(var(--destructive) / 0.15); background: hsl(var(--destructive) / 0.02);">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center" style="background: hsl(var(--destructive) / 0.08);">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" style="color: hsl(var(--destructive) / 0.7);" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.75 3.104v5.714a2.25 2.25 0 01-.659 1.591L5 14.5M9.75 3.104c-.251.023-.501.05-.75.082m.75-.082a24.301 24.301 0 014.5 0m0 0v5.714c0 .597.237 1.17.659 1.591L19.8 15.3M14.25 3.104c.251.023.501.05.75.082M19.8 15.3l-1.57.393A9.065 9.065 0 0112 15a9.065 9.065 0 00-6.23-.693L5 14.5" /></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1">
            <h3 class="font-display text-base md:text-lg font-bold text-foreground">تركيبة غير متكاملة</h3>
            <p class="text-muted-foreground text-sm mt-0.5">بدون فيتامين سي، الجسم لا يستطيع تصنيع الكولاجين أصلاً</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center" style="background: hsl(var(--destructive) / 0.1);">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" style="color: hsl(var(--destructive) / 0.6);" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12" /></svg>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-5 p-5 md:p-6 rounded-xl border animate-on-scroll" style="animation-delay: 0.16s; border-color: hsl(var(--destructive) / 0.15); background: hsl(var(--destructive) / 0.02);">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center" style="background: hsl(var(--destructive) / 0.08);">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" style="color: hsl(var(--destructive) / 0.7);" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.182 16.318A4.486 4.486 0 0012.016 15a4.486 4.486 0 00-3.198 1.318M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0zM9.75 9.75c0 .414-.168.75-.375.75S9 10.164 9 9.75 9.168 9 9.375 9s.375.336.375.75zm-.375 0h.008v.015h-.008V9.75zm5.625 0c0 .414-.168.75-.375.75s-.375-.336-.375-.75.168-.75.375-.75.375.336.375.75zm-.375 0h.008v.015h-.008V9.75z" /></svg>
          </div>
